  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting renewable energy for sustainable recovery in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Lebanese Minister of Industry addressed a letter to the UNIDO Director General requesting UNIDO to support the Government of Lebanon in the development of a programme promoting renewable energy for public buildings.  The permanent mission of Lebanon to UNIDO transmitted the request of Lebanon and requested the allocation of funding unspent under a trust fund financed by the Government of Lebanon to support the request.  This project is a response to the request from the Government of Lebanon</narrative>
  </description>
